Team Fortress 2 image assets
====================================

The PNG files in the `classes` and `items` directories are copyright Valve
Corporation. All rights are reserved by Valve. They are not covered by the MIT
license at the root of this repository and no ownership of them is claimed by
the tf2-archipelago contributors.

They are included solely as part of this non-commercial Team Fortress 2 fan
project under the "License to Use Valve Game Content in Fan Art" in section
2.D of the Steam Subscriber Agreement:

https://store.steampowered.com/subscriber_agreement/

`PROVENANCE.json` records the Official Team Fortress Wiki file page, downloaded
URL, Wiki license template, retrieval date, file size and SHA-256 digest for
every image. Item images use the MD5 of their original Wiki filename as their
local filename because Go embeds reject punctuation found in several weapon
names; the manifest retains the original names and URLs. At the time of
retrieval, every listed page identified its image as either material extracted
from Team Fortress 2 (`ExtractTF2`) or a Team Fortress 2 screenshot
(`ScreenshotTF2`), with copyright held by Valve.

Team Fortress, the Team Fortress logo, Valve and the Valve logo are trademarks
and/or registered trademarks of Valve Corporation. This project is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Valve Corporation.
